  "prefLabel": "Gal 403.09 Retention of Continuing Education Records by Guardians ad Litem",
  "priorExpiration": "2016-10-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gal 403.09 Retention of Continuing Education Records by Guardians ad Litem. All certified and formerly certified 1guardians ad litem shall retain in their possession, for a period of 3 years after claiming a particular activity for continuing education credit, such documentation as will likely serve to verify:\n\n(a) That the activity is of the nature described in Gal 403.02;\n\n(b) The number of credits claimed; and\n\n(c) The person’s actual attendance at or participation in the activity within the applicable time period set forth in these rules.\n\nSource. #8942, eff 9-15-07, EXPIRED: 9-15-15\n\nNew. #11075, INTERIM, eff 4-18-16, EXPIRED: 10-15-16\n\nNew. #12010, eff 10-21-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/gal400.html"
